  "content": {
    "id": "p6-q2-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "What is the domain of each function?",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p6-q2-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$y=\\sqrt{7x}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x\\geq0$",
          "worked": "The radicand must be non-negative.\n$$\\begin{align*}7x&\\geq0\\\\x&\\geq0\\end{align*}$$\nThe domain is $x\\geq0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q2-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$y=\\sqrt{7+x}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x\\geq-7$",
          "worked": "The radicand must be non-negative.\n$$\\begin{align*}7+x&\\geq0\\\\x&\\geq-7\\end{align*}$$\nThe domain is $x\\geq-7$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q2-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$y=\\sqrt{7-x}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x\\leq7$",
          "worked": "The radicand must be non-negative.\n$$\\begin{align*}7-x&\\geq0\\\\7&\\geq x\\\\x&\\leq7\\end{align*}$$\nThe domain is $x\\leq7$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q2-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$y=\\sqrt{7x-1}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x\\geq\\frac{1}{7}$",
          "worked": "The radicand must be non-negative.\n$$\\begin{align*}7x-1&\\geq0\\\\7x&\\geq1\\\\x&\\geq\\frac{1}{7}\\end{align*}$$\nThe domain is $x\\geq\\frac{1}{7}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q2-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$y=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7x}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x>0$",
          "worked": "The square root must be defined and the denominator must not be zero, so the radicand must be positive.\n$$\\begin{align*}7x&>0\\\\x&>0\\end{align*}$$\nThe domain is $x>0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q2-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$y=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x-7}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x>7$",
          "worked": "The square root must be defined and the denominator must not be zero, so the radicand must be positive.\n$$\\begin{align*}x-7&>0\\\\x&>7\\end{align*}$$\nThe domain is $x>7$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      }
    ]
